<title>USA: Tiffany &amp; Co names Kowalski COO.</title>
<headline>Tiffany &amp; Co names Kowalski COO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tiffany &amp; Co said on Tuesday that it named the company's President Michael Kowalski to the additional newly created position of chief operating officer.  </p>
<p>Tiffany also said it appointed Jeanne Daniel to the newly created position of executive vice president of merchandising, and Thomas O'Neill to the post of executive vice president, international.</p>
<p>Tiffany is an international jeweler and specialty retailer.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
